keywords:
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - program synthesis
  - formal verification
  - SMT
  - Z3
  - grokking
  - modular arithmetic
abstract: >-
  Circuit2Code decompiles a small algorithmic Transformer into an equivalent
  Python and ANSI C program whose equivalence is proved by the Z3 SMT solver
  over the entire finite input domain, using certified enclosures of the
  IEEE-754 forward pass as the float-to-real bridge.
